"\n<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#content\">Skip to content</a>\n<div class=\"shell\">\n  <header class=\"topbar\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#start\"><img class=\"brand-logo\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"NocoBase\"><span class=\"version\">3</span><span class=\"doc-label\">Docs</span></a>\n    <div class=\"toplinks\"><span class=\"language\">English</span><a href=\"https://github.com/nocobase/nocobase/tree/v3-develop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub \u2197</a><a href=\"https://nb3.nocobase.cn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Website \u2197</a></div>\n  </header>\n  <main id=\"content\">\n    <section id=\"start\" class=\"quick\" aria-labelledby=\"title\">\n      <div class=\"quickhead\"><div><div class=\"section-label\"><b>NocoBase 3</b><i></i><span>Quick start</span></div><h1 id=\"title\">Start your application with a conversation.</h1><p class=\"lede\">Install Skills, then work with your Agent to create, develop, and deploy your application.</p></div><span class=\"requirements\">Local environment: Node.js 24+ \u00b7 pnpm 11<br>A Coding Agent that supports Skills, such as Claude Code or Codex</span></div>\n      <div class=\"steps\">\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"stepheading\"><span class=\"number\">01</span><h3>Install Skills</h3></div>\n          <p>Install from your local terminal so your Agent knows how to create and deploy NocoBase 3 applications.</p>\n          <div class=\"codebox\"><div class=\"codebar\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"4 17 10 11 4 5\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"19\" y2=\"19\"></line></svg>Local terminal</span><button class=\"copy\" data-copy=\"install\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>Copy</button></div><pre id=\"install\">npx skills@latest add nocobase/skills-v3 --skill '*' -g</pre></div>\n          <div class=\"step-details\"><p>Choose your Agent when prompted. After installation,<strong>start a new session</strong>to load the Skills.</p><details><summary>What is installed? How do I update it?</summary><p>Installs global Skills for application creation, deployment, and plugin development from nocobase/skills-v3. Run the same command again to update them.</p><p>Once created, the application includes development, deployment, and upgrade Skills that match its installed version.</p></details></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"stepheading\"><span class=\"number\">02</span><h3>Create a NocoBase App</h3></div>\n          <p>Open your Agent in an empty directory and ask it to create an application.</p>\n          <div class=\"codebox\"><div class=\"codebar\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M13 8H7\"></path><path d=\"M17 12H7\"></path></svg>Send to your Agent</span><button class=\"copy\" data-copy=\"create\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>Copy prompt</button></div><div class=\"prompttext\" id=\"create\">Create a NocoBase 3 App, start the local development environment, and tell me the application URL and how to sign in.</div></div>\n          <div class=\"step-details\"><p>The Agent installs dependencies, configures the application, and starts it. Use SQLite for a first try, or specify another database.</p><p>After startup, continue in the<strong>application directory</strong>: \u201cI want to build a procurement system.\u201d Discuss the design and plan, then preview and refine it.</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"step\">\n          <div class=\"stepheading\"><span class=\"number\">03</span><h3>Deploy a NocoBase App</h3></div>\n          <p>Once you are happy with the local result, continue in the same project to push the code and deploy the application.</p>\n          <div class=\"codebox\"><div class=\"codebar\"><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M13 8H7\"></path><path d=\"M17 12H7\"></path></svg>Replace the details, then send</span><button class=\"copy\" data-copy=\"deploy\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>Copy prompt</button></div><div class=\"prompttext\" id=\"deploy\">Push the code to the project's Git remote and deploy the application to /app/my-app on ssh user@ip. Verify access after deployment and tell me the production URL.</div></div>\n          <div class=\"step-details\"><p>Replace <code>user@ip</code> and <code>/app/my-app</code> with your SSH destination and installation directory. Include the domain if you have one, and the repository URL if no Git remote is configured.</p><p>The Agent checks SSH access, the server environment, and deployment configuration, then builds, installs, and verifies the application. Later, ask it to upgrade, verify, and deploy again.</p></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"intro conversation\" id=\"agent\" aria-labelledby=\"agent-title\">\n      <div class=\"conversation-intro\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg>Develop with your Agent</div><h2 id=\"agent-title\">From your first idea to ongoing releases</h2><p class=\"description\">Keep the conversation going after creating your application. Discuss the design, make a plan, build features, and open a local preview whenever you need feedback.</p>\n        <div class=\"workflow\">\n          <div><span class=\"number\">1</span><div>Work your way<small>Discuss the design, make a plan, or start implementing.</small></div></div>\n          <div><span class=\"number\">2</span><div>Preview and refine<small>Try the local preview and describe the changes you want.</small></div></div>\n          <div><span class=\"number\">3</span><div>Keep delivering<small>Push code, deploy to your server, and release updates after upgrading.</small></div></div>\n        </div><p class=\"conversation-note\">Here is one possible conversation. Describe the next thing you want to do and let the Agent work in your project's context.</p>\n      </div>\n      <figure class=\"sample conversation-sample\" style=\"margin:0\"><figcaption class=\"codebar\"><span>An ongoing conversation with your Agent</span><span>From local development to deployment</span></figcaption>\n        <ol class=\"chat-flow\">\n          <li><span class=\"chat-index\">01</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">Create an application</span><p>Create a NocoBase 3 App.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"chat-index\">02</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">Describe the business</span><p>Build a procurement system to manage suppliers, purchase orders, and approvals.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"chat-index\">03</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">Discuss the design and plan</span><p>Let's discuss the design and make an implementation plan. We can adjust it as new ideas come up.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"chat-index\">04</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">Preview locally</span><p>Build order management first and start a local preview so I can try it.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"chat-index\">05</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">Keep improving</span><p>Add a status filter to the order list and notify the applicant when approval is complete.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"chat-index\">06</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">Push and deploy</span><p>Push the code and deploy it to /app/my-app on ssh user@ip.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"chat-index\">07</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">Upgrade the application</span><p>Upgrade the NocoBase core while preserving existing business features, then start a local preview to verify the result.</p></div></li>\n          <li><span class=\"chat-index\">08</span><div><span class=\"chat-label\">Deploy the update</span><p>Verification is complete. Deploy the update to production.</p></div></li>\n        </ol>\n        <footer>Replace the business name, SSH destination, and directory with your own details. The Agent checks the environment and requests access when needed.</footer>\n      </figure>\n    </section>\n    <section id=\"capabilities\" aria-labelledby=\"cap-title\"><div class=\"capheader\"><div><div class=\"section-label\"><b>Application capabilities</b><i></i><span>Use as needed</span></div><h2 id=\"cap-title\">The foundations are ready. Focus on your business.</h2><p>Your Agent can reuse these capabilities. Open a module, choose a scenario, and adapt and copy its prompt.</p></div><div class=\"search-wrap\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><input class=\"search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search capabilities\u2026\" aria-label=\"Search capabilities\"></div></div><div class=\"cards\" id=\"cards\"></div><p class=\"empty\" hidden>No matching capabilities. Try another search term.</p></section>\n    <section id=\"ui-library\" aria-labelledby=\"ui-library-title\"><div class=\"ui-library-head\"><div><div class=\"section-label\"><b>Interface examples</b><i></i><span>UI Library</span></div><h2 id=\"ui-library-title\">Find a starting point for your interface.</h2><p>Manage tasks, inspect details, and review requests. Choose an example and describe your business requirements to the Agent.</p></div><a class=\"ui-library-link\" href=\"https://ui.nocobase.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Browse all examples <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a></div><div class=\"ui-gallery\"><article class=\"ui-scene\"><div class=\"ui-scene-about\"><span class=\"ui-scene-label\">01 / Task board</span><h3>See task progress at a glance.</h3><p>Group tasks by pending, in progress, and completed. Drag cards to update their status.</p><small>Grouped views \u00b7 Task cards \u00b7 Drag and drop</small><a class=\"ui-library-link\" href=\"https://ui.nocobase.com/#kanban\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open interactive example <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a></div><div class=\"ui-preview\"><iframe src=\"https://ui.nocobase.com/demo/components/kanban\" title=\"Interactive task board preview\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div><div class=\"ui-agent-example\"><div><small>Try this prompt</small><p id=\"ui-prompt-kanban\">Use https://ui.nocobase.com/#kanban as a reference to build a project task board. Group tasks by pending, in progress, and completed; show owners and due dates on cards and save status changes after dragging.</p></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"ui-prompt-kanban\">Copy prompt</button></div></article><article class=\"ui-scene\"><div class=\"ui-scene-about\"><span class=\"ui-scene-label\">02 / Detail drawer</span><h3>Inspect details without losing your place.</h3><p>Keep the list in context while viewing and editing details in a side drawer.</p><small>List and details \u00b7 Side drawer \u00b7 Inline editing</small><a class=\"ui-library-link\" href=\"https://ui.nocobase.com/#route-drawer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open interactive example <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a></div><div class=\"ui-preview\"><iframe src=\"https://ui.nocobase.com/demo/components/route-overlays/SO-1043\" title=\"Interactive detail drawer preview\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div><div class=\"ui-agent-example\"><div><small>Try this prompt</small><p id=\"ui-prompt-route-drawer\">Use https://ui.nocobase.com/#route-drawer as a reference to build a customer detail drawer. Keep the customer list visible, show basic information, follow-up history, and related orders in the drawer, and allow editing customer information.</p></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"ui-prompt-route-drawer\">Copy prompt</button></div></article><article class=\"ui-scene\"><div class=\"ui-scene-about\"><span class=\"ui-scene-label\">03 / Request approval</span><h3>Know who reviews next and where things stand.</h3><p>Bring progress, decisions, and action history together for applicants and reviewers.</p><small>Approval progress \u00b7 Action history \u00b7 Review actions</small><a class=\"ui-library-link\" href=\"https://ui.nocobase.com/#approval-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open interactive example <span aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2197</span></a></div><div class=\"ui-preview\"><iframe src=\"https://ui.nocobase.com/demo/approval/approval-ui\" title=\"Interactive approval preview\" loading=\"lazy\"></iframe></div><div class=\"ui-agent-example\"><div><small>Try this prompt</small><p id=\"ui-prompt-approval-ui\">Use https://ui.nocobase.com/#approval-ui as a reference to build an expense approval page. Show the current reviewer, stage status, and history, with approve, return, and transfer actions according to the current user's permissions.</p></div><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"ui-prompt-approval-ui\">Copy prompt</button></div></article></div><p class=\"ui-library-note\">These interactive previews come from the UI Library. Your Agent connects business data, permissions, and workflows in the current application.</p></section>\n<footer class=\"end\"><span>NocoBase 3 \u00b7 Documentation</span><span>Open source \u00b7 Self-hosted \u00b7 Your choice of models and Agents</span></footer>\n  </main>\n</div>\n<dialog id=\"prompt-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"dialog-title\" aria-describedby=\"dialog-description\">\n  <header class=\"prompt-header\"><span class=\"icon\" id=\"dialog-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><div><h2 id=\"dialog-title\"></h2><p id=\"dialog-description\"></p></div><button class=\"close\" aria-label=\"Close dialog\">\u00d7</button></header>\n  <div class=\"prompt-body\"><div class=\"prompt-tabs\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Choose a prompt scenario\"></div><div id=\"prompt-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\"><textarea aria-label=\"Prompt\" id=\"prompt-editor\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea></div><p class=\"prompt-hint\">Adapt the prompt to your business before copying. Edits are discarded when you close the dialog.</p></div>\n  <footer class=\"prompt-footer\"><button id=\"reset-prompt\" class=\"reset-button\" disabled><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 11a9 9 0 1 1 3 7M3 4v7h7\"/></svg>Restore default</button><div class=\"prompt-actions\"><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"close-prompt\">Close</button><button class=\"primary\" id=\"copy-prompt\">Copy</button></div></footer>\n</dialog>\n<div class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n"
